(7723239, 1271464, 163081, '<td valign="top">I wanted to have super clear ice cubes. I googled for some techniques to have super clear ice. the result was nice but it takes a long time to  get it done. It is really hot here in Taiwan new, and even at home with the AC running, the ice melts very fast. I had to use a glass plate to keep the water from running everywhere.<br/>Too bad it didn''t score higher. I think that cloudy ice is a quick done job.</td>', 'I wanted to have super clear ice cubes. I googled for some techniques to have super clear ice. the result was nice but it takes a long time to  get it done. It is really hot here in Taiwan new, and even at home with the AC running, the ice melts very fast. I had to use a glass plate to keep the water from running everywhere.Too bad it didn''t score higher. I think that cloudy ice is a quick done job.', '2022-07-11 10:43:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7723240, 1271466, 77543, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JustinM:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the color shifts. Curious if you have an outtake that was lit solely with the blue light. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is the third of just three frames. All had the same lighting. I just adjusted the focal length and the positions of the two flashes.</td>', 'Originally posted by JustinM: I like the color shifts. Curious if you have an outtake that was lit solely with the blue light.   This is the third of just three frames. All had the same lighting. I just adjusted the focal length and the positions of the two flashes.', '2022-07-11 11:02:43.000000', NULL, 0),
